{"title":"Alum","sourceTitle":"Alum/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages noprint navigation-not-searchable\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-pt-languages-label\">Other languages:</div><ul class=\"mw-pt-languages-list\"><li><a href=\"/Alum/de\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Alaun (30% translated)\" lang=\"de\" dir=\"ltr\">Deutsch</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Alum\" class=\"mw-pt-languages-ui mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Alum (100% translated)\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">English</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Alum/fr\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--med\" title=\"Alun (50% translated)\" lang=\"fr\" dir=\"ltr\">français</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"mw-pt-languages-selected mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" lang=\"pt-BR\" dir=\"ltr\">português do Brasil</span></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Alum/ru\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"Квасцы (100% translated)\" lang=\"ru\" dir=\"ltr\">русский</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/Alum/zh\" class=\"mw-pt-progress mw-pt-progress--complete\" title=\"明矾 (100% translated)\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\">中文</a></li></ul></div>\n<div class=\"center\" style=\"background-color: #eee; border-style: solid; border-width: 1px 1px 1px 4px; border-color: #88acf5; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 85%; width: 90%; padding: 0.2em; margin: 0.5em auto; margin-left:0px;\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: flex-start; align-items: center; padding-left: 10px\">\n<div style=\"margin-left: 10px; text-align: left;\">\n<p>Esta página foi verificada pela última vez para a versão do Vintage Story <b>1.20.12</b>.\n</p>\n</div></div></div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Alume</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Ore-alum.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/16/Ore-alum.png/100px-Ore-alum.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/16/Ore-alum.png/150px-Ore-alum.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/16/Ore-alum.png/200px-Ore-alum.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Alum</b> é um mineral que pode ser triturado e diluído para criar <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye#Mordant\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">mordente</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye#Mordant\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span> para preparar tecidos para tingimento.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><span id=\"Creation\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Cria.C3.A7.C3.A3o\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Criação\">Criação</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/File:Alum-in-rocks.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/1/19/Alum-in-rocks.png/400px-Alum-in-rocks.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"76\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/1/19/Alum-in-rocks.png/600px-Alum-in-rocks.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/1/19/Alum-in-rocks.png/800px-Alum-in-rocks.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"1868\" data-file-height=\"353\" /></a><figcaption>Alúmen em rochas.</figcaption></figure>\n<p>O alume pode ser encontrado como minério em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rock#Sedimentary_rocks\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rock\">rocha sedimentar</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rock#Sedimentary_rocks\" title=\"Rock\"> </a></span> (giz, sílex, conglomerado, calcário, argilito, arenito e xisto). Alúmen de mineração requer uma picareta <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Copper\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Copper\">cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper\" title=\"Copper\"> </a></span> e produz 1,25<abbr title=\"1 + 25% chance\">*</abbr> alúmen por bloco.\n</p><p>Pedaços de alume também podem ser adquiridos de um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">Comerciante de commodities</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Commodities\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span>, a um custo de 8 alume para 4.5 - 7.5<abbr title=\"2,5 significa 2 + 50% de chance\">*</abbr> <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Rusty_gears\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Rusty gears\">engrenagens</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Rusty_gears\" title=\"Rusty gears\"> </a></span>.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><span id=\"Usage\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Uso\">Uso</span></h2>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"position:relative; border-radius:7px; font-size:90%; width:300px; float:right; margin-left:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"border-top-right-radius:7px; border-top-left-radius:7px; text-align:center; font-size:13.5px;\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Alume moído</b></font>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#d3ab92\" colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/File:Crushed-alum.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/7/7f/Crushed-alum.png/100px-Crushed-alum.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/7/7f/Crushed-alum.png/150px-Crushed-alum.png 1.5x, /images/thumb/7/7f/Crushed-alum.png/200px-Crushed-alum.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"400\" data-file-height=\"400\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Empilhável</b>\n</td>\n<td>64\n</td></tr>\n\n\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#000000\" colspan=\"2\" class=\"Bloba\" style=\"text-align:center; font-size:13.5px; border-bottom-right-radius:7px; border-bottom-left-radius:7px;\"><a href=\"/Items\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Items\"><font color=\"white\"><b>Itens</b></font></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Pedaços de alume devem primeiro ser esmagados em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pulverizer\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pulverizer\">pulverizador</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pulverizer\" title=\"Pulverizer\"> </a></span> para produzir alume triturado. O alume triturado é então misturado com água em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Barrel\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Barrel\">barril</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Barrel\" title=\"Barrel\"> </a></span> para produzir alume diluído, que é usado como <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Dye#Mordant\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Dye\">mordente</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Dye#Mordant\" title=\"Dye\"> </a></span> para preparar tecidos para tingimento.\n<br style=\"clear:both\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin: auto; padding: 4px; border-color: #382b1e; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid; margin: auto; width: 90%; border-radius: 4px; background-color: #e0cfbb;\">\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"border-spacing: 2px; width: 100%;\">\n  <tbody><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"background: rgb(91,76,62); background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(91,76,62,0) 5px, rgba(56,43,30,0) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%), linear-gradient(to right, rgba(91,76,62,1) 0px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 5px, rgba(69,52,36,1) 50%, rgba(69,52,36,1) calc(100% - 5px), rgba(56,43,30,1) 100%);\">\n    <big><b><span style=\"color: #e0cfbb\">Minérios, metais e minerais</span></b></big></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Guias</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #e0cfbb;\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\">Depósitos de minério</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ore_Deposits/pt-br\" title=\"Ore Deposits/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\">Metais</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Metal/pt-br\" title=\"Metal/pt-br\"> </a></span></td>\n  </tr>\n<tr>\n    <td style=\"height: 30px; text-align: center; width: 10%; background: #5B4C3E; color:#e0cfbb;\"><b>Metais</b></td>\n    <td style=\"background: #CCBCAB;\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\">Cobre</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Copper/pt-br\" title=\"Copper/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\">Ferro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Iron/pt-br\" title=\"Iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Meteoric_iron/pt-br\" title=\"Meteoric iron/pt-br\">Ferro meteórico</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Meteoric_iron/pt-br\" title=\"Meteoric iron/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Gold/pt-br\" title=\"Gold/pt-br\">Ouro</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Gold/pt-br\" title=\"Gold/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Silver/pt-br\" title=\"Silver/pt-br\">Prata</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Silver/pt-br\" title=\"Silver/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Lead/pt-br\" title=\"Lead/pt-br\">Chumbo</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Lead/pt-br\" title=\"Lead/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Tin/pt-br\" title=\"Tin/pt-br\">Estanho</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Tin/pt-br\" title=\"Tin/pt-br\"> </a></span> • <a href=\"/Zinc/pt-br\" title=\"Zinc/pt-br\">Zinco</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Zinc/pt-br\" title=\"Zinc/pt-br\"> </a></spa